OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm fed up of swiping': The
OL,4,Asingles choosing dating events over
OL,5,Aapps
OL,6,
OL,7,FChecking in at a dating event in a bar
OL,8,Fin Guildford, Olivia Miller-Davis is
OL,9,Funderstandably apprehensive.
OL,11,FEven bringing a friend with her doesn't
OL,12,Fremove the awkwardness at the start of
OL,13,Fthe night.
OL,15,F"It's always nerve-wracking when you're
OL,16,Fmeeting new people," the 28-year-old
OL,17,Fadmits before downloading an app that
OL,18,Fwill match her to other daters based on
OL,19,Ftheir star signs.
